  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了第十到第六，茶卡盐湖是一面镜子，洱海是一张成绩单。千岛湖是一座泡在水里的博物馆，赛仙湖是一个藏着秘密的深渊，赛里木湖是大西洋的一滴眼泪。好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。有人说西湖呢、青海湖呢喀纳斯湖呢？别急，今天这集就是第五道到第一一个比一个狠，最后那个养活了一整个高原。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第五名，浙江西湖，在浙江杭州这湖最绝的不是水是人。白居易来过苏东坡来过他们，不光来看，还动手修白堤、苏堤都是他们带人修的。西湖的歌格局，一壶两堤三倒一池三山，成了中国园林的教科书。南宋的时候，评了西湖十景、苏堤春晓、断桥残雪、柳浪、文英，每一个井都是一首诗。二零一一年，西湖文化景观列入世界遗产名录，成为中国第一处以文化景观申报成功的遗产。别的湖美在自然，西湖美在人跟，自然一起过了。两千年第四名，西藏纳木错在西藏拉萨当雄县湖面海拔四千七百一十八米。藏语里纳姆。错的意思是，天湖，因为这湖太高了，高的像在天上这壶，最绝的是他每年冬天整面湖冻成一块巨大的冰。五月冰面开始裂开，发出轰隆隆的巨响，像打雷一样，当地人叫开壶。开湖那天，湖面上的冰一块一块裂开，推着挤着发出雷鸣般的声音，站在湖边脚下在震耳朵里全是轰响。您说这是湖还是老天爷在跟大地说话？我前阵子翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，左边一页是每个地方的实景大图，加一段五十来个字的冷知识，右边是日期计时页，什么季节去哪座湖，走哪条路，看什么风景最合适，都给你安排好了。不是那种千篇一律的景点介绍，是帮你挑日子。今天翻到纳木错，明天翻到喀纳斯，后天翻到泸沽湖，翻到哪页，就觉得那个地方在喊你我自己的习惯是每天早起翻一页当个消遣，翻到一个从来没听说过的小地方，就去网上搜搜照片，搜完就想订票。我已经放下面了，点开就能看到喜欢到处走走的朋友，弄一本放茶几。上一年下来，整个中国哪值得去，哪个乐曲，心里全有谱了。第三名，云南泸沽湖在四川盐源和云南宁确的交界处，湖面海拔约两千七百米。这湖最绝的是湖边住着一群人，摩梭人，摩梭人到现在还保留着母系大家庭。家里由最年长的女性当家，孩子跟着妈妈姓舅舅负责养家。走婚桥是摩梭男女约会的地方。泸沽湖的水面上飘着一朵花，叫波叶海菜，花白色的花瓣，黄色的花蕊只在干净的水里才能活。您坐着竹草船穿过花海船，底下是清清的水，水底下是长长的花茎。您说这是湖还是东方女儿国的一个梦？第二名，新疆喀纳斯湖嗯在新疆阿勒泰布尔金县湖面海拔一千三百七十四米，最深处一百八十八米。这壶最绝的是他会变色。同一个湖，早上看是青灰色，中午看是碧蓝色，下午看是翠绿色，傍晚看又变成了暗紫色，所以叫变色壶。为什么变色？因为湖水来自冰川水里，含着不同的矿物质，加上光线角度不同，水就跟着变更。邪乎的是水怪。当地人传了好几代，说，狐狸有巨兽，能把湖边喝水的马拖下水。科考队用环境DNA技术检测，发现湖里有巨大的折罗龟能长到好几米，可到底有没有水怪？到现在没人说得清。一池湖水一个传说，勾了全世界几十年的好奇心。第一名。青海湖在青海、海南和海北之间，湖面四千六百五十平方公里，中国最大的内陆咸水湖。这湖最绝的不是大，是他养活了半个高原的生命。青海湖罗里就是筛鱼，资源量从二零零二年的两千五百多吨，恢复到了现在的十二万多吨。俯世园林，全世界只剩几千只大半，在青海湖边数量增加到了三千七百多只。每年有六十多万只水鸟飞到青海湖，有三百多种鸟。您站在湖边看，天上飞的是鸟，水里游的是鱼，草原上跑的是羚羊，一个湖，撑起了一整个高原的生态。别的湖美在颜色，青海湖美在，他是以整个高原的生命之源。您说这个第一名服不服？您听出来了没有？这十个湖没有一个是因为好看才排上来的。茶卡盐湖靠的是一面镜子，洱海靠的是水，越来越干净。千岛湖靠的是一座泡在水里的博物馆。抚仙湖靠的是一个深渊，赛里木湖靠的是大西洋的一滴眼泪。西湖靠的是人跟自然过了两千年，纳木错靠的是老天爷在说话。泸沽湖靠的是东方女儿国，喀纳斯湖靠的是变色和水怪。青海湖靠的是养活了一整个高原，每一个湖的厉害之处都不在他有多难，在他有多厚点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00001",
      "start_ms": 210,
      "end_ms": 770,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1010,
      "end_ms": 3030,
      "text": "咱们盘了第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3930,
      "end_ms": 6330,
      "text": "茶卡盐湖是一面镜子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6970,
      "end_ms": 8910,
      "text": "洱海是一张成绩单。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9590,
      "end_ms": 12910,
      "text": "千岛湖是一座泡在水里的博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13610,
      "end_ms": 16930,
      "text": "赛仙湖是一个藏着秘密的深渊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17430,
      "end_ms": 20030,
      "text": "赛里木湖是大西洋的一滴眼泪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20810,
      "end_ms": 23190,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23470,
      "end_ms": 27270,
      "text": "有人说西湖呢、青海湖呢喀纳斯湖呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27370,
      "end_ms": 27870,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28330,
      "end_ms": 32200,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道到第一一个比一个狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00012",
      "start_ms": 32620,
      "end_ms": 35140,
      "text": "最后那个养活了一整个高原。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00013",
      "start_ms": 35680,
      "end_ms": 36340,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36640,
      "end_ms": 37540,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00015",
      "start_ms": 37800,
      "end_ms": 39860,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00016",
      "start_ms": 40100,
      "end_ms": 43820,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00017",
      "start_ms": 44120,
      "end_ms": 45140,
      "text": "浙江西湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00018",
      "start_ms": 45500,
      "end_ms": 49920,
      "text": "在浙江杭州这湖最绝的不是水是人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00019",
      "start_ms": 50600,
      "end_ms": 53580,
      "text": "白居易来过苏东坡来过他们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00020",
      "start_ms": 53580,
      "end_ms": 54220,
      "text": "不光来看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00021",
      "start_ms": 54400,
      "end_ms": 58960,
      "text": "还动手修白堤、苏堤都是他们带人修的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00022",
      "start_ms": 59200,
      "end_ms": 60405,
      "text": "西湖的歌格局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60700,
      "end_ms": 63015,
      "text": "一壶两堤三倒一池三山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00024",
      "start_ms": 63390,
      "end_ms": 65075,
      "text": "成了中国园林的教科书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65490,
      "end_ms": 66625,
      "text": "南宋的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66920,
      "end_ms": 73645,
      "text": "评了西湖十景、苏堤春晓、断桥残雪、柳浪、文英，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00027",
      "start_ms": 73970,
      "end_ms": 75785,
      "text": "每一个井都是一首诗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00028",
      "start_ms": 76870,
      "end_ms": 77815,
      "text": "二零一一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00029",
      "start_ms": 78660,
      "end_ms": 81795,
      "text": "西湖文化景观列入世界遗产名录，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00030",
      "start_ms": 82650,
      "end_ms": 87675,
      "text": "成为中国第一处以文化景观申报成功的遗产。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00031",
      "start_ms": 88070,
      "end_ms": 89435,
      "text": "别的湖美在自然，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00032",
      "start_ms": 89930,
      "end_ms": 90990,
      "text": "西湖美在人跟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00033",
      "start_ms": 90990,
      "end_ms": 92250,
      "text": "自然一起过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00034",
      "start_ms": 92250,
      "end_ms": 94745,
      "text": "两千年第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00035",
      "start_ms": 95580,
      "end_ms": 103275,
      "text": "西藏纳木错在西藏拉萨当雄县湖面海拔四千七百一十八米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00036",
      "start_ms": 103600,
      "end_ms": 104780,
      "text": "藏语里纳姆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00037",
      "start_ms": 104780,
      "end_ms": 105725,
      "text": "错的意思是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00038",
      "start_ms": 106170,
      "end_ms": 106785,
      "text": "天湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00039",
      "start_ms": 107180,
      "end_ms": 108520,
      "text": "因为这湖太高了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00040",
      "start_ms": 108520,
      "end_ms": 110550,
      "text": "高的像在天上这壶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00041",
      "start_ms": 110590,
      "end_ms": 115860,
      "text": "最绝的是他每年冬天整面湖冻成一块巨大的冰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00042",
      "start_ms": 116040,
      "end_ms": 119025,
      "text": "五月冰面开始裂开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00043",
      "start_ms": 119620,
      "end_ms": 121175,
      "text": "发出轰隆隆的巨响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00044",
      "start_ms": 122030,
      "end_ms": 123125,
      "text": "像打雷一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00045",
      "start_ms": 123950,
      "end_ms": 125225,
      "text": "当地人叫开壶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00046",
      "start_ms": 126250,
      "end_ms": 127055,
      "text": "开湖那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00047",
      "start_ms": 127340,
      "end_ms": 129515,
      "text": "湖面上的冰一块一块裂开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00048",
      "start_ms": 130490,
      "end_ms": 133565,
      "text": "推着挤着发出雷鸣般的声音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00049",
      "start_ms": 133850,
      "end_ms": 137635,
      "text": "站在湖边脚下在震耳朵里全是轰响。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00050",
      "start_ms": 138100,
      "end_ms": 141300,
      "text": "您说这是湖还是老天爷在跟大地说话？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00051",
      "start_ms": 141580,
      "end_ms": 145905,
      "text": "我前阵子翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00052",
      "start_ms": 146550,
      "end_ms": 149630,
      "text": "左边一页是每个地方的实景大图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00053",
      "start_ms": 149670,
      "end_ms": 152925,
      "text": "加一段五十来个字的冷知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00054",
      "start_ms": 153190,
      "end_ms": 154805,
      "text": "右边是日期计时页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00055",
      "start_ms": 155230,
      "end_ms": 156985,
      "text": "什么季节去哪座湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00056",
      "start_ms": 157380,
      "end_ms": 158180,
      "text": "走哪条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00057",
      "start_ms": 158240,
      "end_ms": 159945,
      "text": "看什么风景最合适，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00058",
      "start_ms": 160310,
      "end_ms": 161515,
      "text": "都给你安排好了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00059",
      "start_ms": 162140,
      "end_ms": 165025,
      "text": "不是那种千篇一律的景点介绍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00060",
      "start_ms": 165660,
      "end_ms": 167135,
      "text": "是帮你挑日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00061",
      "start_ms": 168150,
      "end_ms": 169730,
      "text": "今天翻到纳木错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00062",
      "start_ms": 169950,
      "end_ms": 171485,
      "text": "明天翻到喀纳斯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00063",
      "start_ms": 171890,
      "end_ms": 173315,
      "text": "后天翻到泸沽湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00064",
      "start_ms": 173930,
      "end_ms": 174750,
      "text": "翻到哪页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00065",
      "start_ms": 174810,
      "end_ms": 180590,
      "text": "就觉得那个地方在喊你我自己的习惯是每天早起翻一页当个消遣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00066",
      "start_ms": 181190,
      "end_ms": 183990,
      "text": "翻到一个从来没听说过的小地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00067",
      "start_ms": 184370,
      "end_ms": 185770,
      "text": "就去网上搜搜照片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00068",
      "start_ms": 186190,
      "end_ms": 187510,
      "text": "搜完就想订票。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00069",
      "start_ms": 187850,
      "end_ms": 189090,
      "text": "我已经放下面了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00070",
      "start_ms": 189090,
      "end_ms": 192570,
      "text": "点开就能看到喜欢到处走走的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00071",
      "start_ms": 192690,
      "end_ms": 193890,
      "text": "弄一本放茶几。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00072",
      "start_ms": 193890,
      "end_ms": 195430,
      "text": "上一年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00073",
      "start_ms": 195630,
      "end_ms": 197210,
      "text": "整个中国哪值得去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00074",
      "start_ms": 197230,
      "end_ms": 197930,
      "text": "哪个乐曲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00075",
      "start_ms": 198250,
      "end_ms": 199395,
      "text": "心里全有谱了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00076",
      "start_ms": 201150,
      "end_ms": 201790,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00077",
      "start_ms": 202270,
      "end_ms": 207290,
      "text": "云南泸沽湖在四川盐源和云南宁确的交界处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00078",
      "start_ms": 207610,
      "end_ms": 209490,
      "text": "湖面海拔约两千七百米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00079",
      "start_ms": 210170,
      "end_ms": 213210,
      "text": "这湖最绝的是湖边住着一群人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00080",
      "start_ms": 213390,
      "end_ms": 214050,
      "text": "摩梭人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00081",
      "start_ms": 214810,
      "end_ms": 217810,
      "text": "摩梭人到现在还保留着母系大家庭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00082",
      "start_ms": 218190,
      "end_ms": 220810,
      "text": "家里由最年长的女性当家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00083",
      "start_ms": 221190,
      "end_ms": 224090,
      "text": "孩子跟着妈妈姓舅舅负责养家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00084",
      "start_ms": 224250,
      "end_ms": 227330,
      "text": "走婚桥是摩梭男女约会的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00085",
      "start_ms": 228270,
      "end_ms": 230805,
      "text": "泸沽湖的水面上飘着一朵花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00086",
      "start_ms": 231360,
      "end_ms": 233040,
      "text": "叫波叶海菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00087",
      "start_ms": 233100,
      "end_ms": 235180,
      "text": "花白色的花瓣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00088",
      "start_ms": 235460,
      "end_ms": 238680,
      "text": "黄色的花蕊只在干净的水里才能活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00089",
      "start_ms": 239240,
      "end_ms": 242410,
      "text": "您坐着竹草船穿过花海船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00090",
      "start_ms": 242410,
      "end_ms": 243725,
      "text": "底下是清清的水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00091",
      "start_ms": 244080,
      "end_ms": 245775,
      "text": "水底下是长长的花茎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00092",
      "start_ms": 246560,
      "end_ms": 249985,
      "text": "您说这是湖还是东方女儿国的一个梦？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00093",
      "start_ms": 251310,
      "end_ms": 251825,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00094",
      "start_ms": 252290,
      "end_ms": 259545,
      "text": "新疆喀纳斯湖嗯在新疆阿勒泰布尔金县湖面海拔一千三百七十四米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00095",
      "start_ms": 260120,
      "end_ms": 262145,
      "text": "最深处一百八十八米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00096",
      "start_ms": 262350,
      "end_ms": 264705,
      "text": "这壶最绝的是他会变色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00097",
      "start_ms": 265550,
      "end_ms": 266315,
      "text": "同一个湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00098",
      "start_ms": 266540,
      "end_ms": 267865,
      "text": "早上看是青灰色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00099",
      "start_ms": 268170,
      "end_ms": 269585,
      "text": "中午看是碧蓝色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00100",
      "start_ms": 269910,
      "end_ms": 271195,
      "text": "下午看是翠绿色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00101",
      "start_ms": 271520,
      "end_ms": 273725,
      "text": "傍晚看又变成了暗紫色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00102",
      "start_ms": 274010,
      "end_ms": 275065,
      "text": "所以叫变色壶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00103",
      "start_ms": 275510,
      "end_ms": 276605,
      "text": "为什么变色？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00104",
      "start_ms": 277160,
      "end_ms": 280670,
      "text": "因为湖水来自冰川水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00105",
      "start_ms": 280670,
      "end_ms": 282135,
      "text": "含着不同的矿物质，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00106",
      "start_ms": 282720,
      "end_ms": 284415,
      "text": "加上光线角度不同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00107",
      "start_ms": 284750,
      "end_ms": 286730,
      "text": "水就跟着变更。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00108",
      "start_ms": 286750,
      "end_ms": 287985,
      "text": "邪乎的是水怪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00109",
      "start_ms": 288860,
      "end_ms": 290375,
      "text": "当地人传了好几代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00110",
      "start_ms": 290800,
      "end_ms": 291020,
      "text": "说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00111",
      "start_ms": 291020,
      "end_ms": 292035,
      "text": "狐狸有巨兽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00112",
      "start_ms": 292540,
      "end_ms": 294945,
      "text": "能把湖边喝水的马拖下水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00113",
      "start_ms": 295920,
      "end_ms": 298840,
      "text": "科考队用环境DNA技术检测，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00114",
      "start_ms": 299120,
      "end_ms": 303280,
      "text": "发现湖里有巨大的折罗龟能长到好几米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00115",
      "start_ms": 303600,
      "end_ms": 305120,
      "text": "可到底有没有水怪？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00116",
      "start_ms": 305600,
      "end_ms": 307520,
      "text": "到现在没人说得清。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00117",
      "start_ms": 307820,
      "end_ms": 309920,
      "text": "一池湖水一个传说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00118",
      "start_ms": 310280,
      "end_ms": 312600,
      "text": "勾了全世界几十年的好奇心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00119",
      "start_ms": 313060,
      "end_ms": 313620,
      "text": "第一名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00120",
      "start_ms": 313860,
      "end_ms": 317460,
      "text": "青海湖在青海、海南和海北之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00121",
      "start_ms": 317740,
      "end_ms": 320260,
      "text": "湖面四千六百五十平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00122",
      "start_ms": 320680,
      "end_ms": 323500,
      "text": "中国最大的内陆咸水湖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00123",
      "start_ms": 324060,
      "end_ms": 326230,
      "text": "这湖最绝的不是大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00124",
      "start_ms": 326590,
      "end_ms": 328790,
      "text": "是他养活了半个高原的生命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00125",
      "start_ms": 329370,
      "end_ms": 331790,
      "text": "青海湖罗里就是筛鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00126",
      "start_ms": 332210,
      "end_ms": 336150,
      "text": "资源量从二零零二年的两千五百多吨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00127",
      "start_ms": 336270,
      "end_ms": 338850,
      "text": "恢复到了现在的十二万多吨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00128",
      "start_ms": 339690,
      "end_ms": 340690,
      "text": "俯世园林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00129",
      "start_ms": 341370,
      "end_ms": 344290,
      "text": "全世界只剩几千只大半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00130",
      "start_ms": 344290,
      "end_ms": 348950,
      "text": "在青海湖边数量增加到了三千七百多只。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00131",
      "start_ms": 349810,
      "end_ms": 353630,
      "text": "每年有六十多万只水鸟飞到青海湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00132",
      "start_ms": 353910,
      "end_ms": 355485,
      "text": "有三百多种鸟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00133",
      "start_ms": 356430,
      "end_ms": 357835,
      "text": "您站在湖边看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00134",
      "start_ms": 358690,
      "end_ms": 360045,
      "text": "天上飞的是鸟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00135",
      "start_ms": 360750,
      "end_ms": 362065,
      "text": "水里游的是鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00136",
      "start_ms": 362900,
      "end_ms": 364995,
      "text": "草原上跑的是羚羊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00137",
      "start_ms": 365870,
      "end_ms": 366515,
      "text": "一个湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00138",
      "start_ms": 367430,
      "end_ms": 369925,
      "text": "撑起了一整个高原的生态。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00139",
      "start_ms": 370400,
      "end_ms": 371905,
      "text": "别的湖美在颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00140",
      "start_ms": 372430,
      "end_ms": 373765,
      "text": "青海湖美在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00141",
      "start_ms": 374140,
      "end_ms": 376725,
      "text": "他是以整个高原的生命之源。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00142",
      "start_ms": 378410,
      "end_ms": 380455,
      "text": "您说这个第一名服不服？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00143",
      "start_ms": 380760,
      "end_ms": 381775,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00144",
      "start_ms": 382230,
      "end_ms": 386375,
      "text": "这十个湖没有一个是因为好看才排上来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00145",
      "start_ms": 386960,
      "end_ms": 389055,
      "text": "茶卡盐湖靠的是一面镜子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00146",
      "start_ms": 389570,
      "end_ms": 390790,
      "text": "洱海靠的是水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00147",
      "start_ms": 390930,
      "end_ms": 391915,
      "text": "越来越干净。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00148",
      "start_ms": 392550,
      "end_ms": 395425,
      "text": "千岛湖靠的是一座泡在水里的博物馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00149",
      "start_ms": 395950,
      "end_ms": 398095,
      "text": "抚仙湖靠的是一个深渊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00150",
      "start_ms": 398710,
      "end_ms": 401755,
      "text": "赛里木湖靠的是大西洋的一滴眼泪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00151",
      "start_ms": 402430,
      "end_ms": 405365,
      "text": "西湖靠的是人跟自然过了两千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00152",
      "start_ms": 406070,
      "end_ms": 408355,
      "text": "纳木错靠的是老天爷在说话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00153",
      "start_ms": 408860,
      "end_ms": 411045,
      "text": "泸沽湖靠的是东方女儿国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00154",
      "start_ms": 411540,
      "end_ms": 414220,
      "text": "喀纳斯湖靠的是变色和水怪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00155",
      "start_ms": 414380,
      "end_ms": 417235,
      "text": "青海湖靠的是养活了一整个高原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00156",
      "start_ms": 418050,
      "end_ms": 421115,
      "text": "每一个湖的厉害之处都不在他有多难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00157",
      "start_ms": 421480,
      "end_ms": 423435,
      "text": "在他有多厚点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9e2a55ffcca9398_s00158",
      "start_ms": 423760,
      "end_ms": 425265,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
